    },
    {
      "req_id": "3",
      "path": "3",
      "text": "Crime in Your Community, State, and Nation. Do the following:",
      "subrequirements": [
        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "3.a",
          "text": "With your parent or guardian's permission and the approval of your counselor, research local, state, or national news coverage of three crimes of different types. Research how common these types of crimes are in your state or in the United States.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "5 Incredible Prison Rehabilitation Programs (video)",
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XmqL65ZBx44&t=23s"
            },
            {
              "title": "What the Data Says About Crime in the U.S. and Substances (video)",
              "url": "https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2024/04/24/what-the-data-says-about-crime-in-the-us/"
            },
            {
              "title": "Top 5 Common Crimes in the USA (video)",
              "url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/_W__yWCaCW0"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "b",
          "path": "3.b",
          "text": "Record notes on which law enforcement agencies and courts were involved in the pursuit of justice for the victims and the accused person, why you think these crimes were committed, and what could be done to prevent similar crimes. Review your research with your counselor."
        }
      ],
      "subrequirement_mode": {
        "type": "all"
      }
    },
    {
      "req_id": "4",
      "path": "4",
      "text": "Home and Neighborhood Crime Prevention. Do the following:",
      "subrequirements": [
        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "4.a",
          "text": "Discuss the following with your counselor:",
          "subrequirements": [
            {
              "req_id": "1",
              "path": "4.a.1",
              "text": "How participation in activities of families, churches, sports teams, and clubs prevents crime.",
              "resources": [
                {
                  "title": "Church members Escape Crime-Ridden Lives (video)",
                  "url": "https://youtu.be/GG5UkPNxBHU?si=4vsdLjvlfQEauAOD"
                },
                {
                  "title": "How Can Boxing Clubs Help Prevent Crime (video)",
                  "url": "https://youtu.be/oEJoZnsgUZA?si=eaTS6FuXVW2mndEo"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "req_id": "2",
              "path": "4.a.2",
              "text": "How designs of houses, neighborhoods, public buildings, stores, streets, and parks prevent crime.",
              "resources": [
                {
                  "title": "What is CPTED? (video)",
                  "url": "https://youtu.be/p3UY1w1O3PA"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Designing Out Crime: CPTED (video)",
                  "url": "https://youtu.be/CZ5sVtt9-8I"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "subrequirement_mode": {
            "type": "all"
          }
        },
        {
          "req_id": "b",
          "path": "4.b",
          "text": "Conduct a security survey of a home, a neighborhood, a park, or a camp building with adult supervision and following youth protection guidelines using a security checklist in the Crime Prevention merit badge pamphlet or one approved by your counselor.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Home Security Checklists # 1 and # 2 (PDF)",
              "url": "https://filestore.scouting.org/filestore/Merit_Badge_ReqandRes/Requirement%20Resources/Crime%20Prevention/Home%20Security%20Checklists%20%231%20%232.pdf"
            },
            {
              "title": "Camp Security Checklists # 1 and # 2 (PDF)",
              "url": "https://filestore.scouting.org/filestore/Merit_Badge_ReqandRes/Requirement%20Resources/Crime%20Prevention/Camp%20Security%20Checklists%20%231%20%232%2001%202026.pdf"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "c",
          "path": "4.c",
          "text": "Use information from your survey for requirement 4(b) and the EDGE method to develop a lesson about how a family or Scouts can protect themselves from crime. Review your teaching plan with your counselor, then present your lesson to your family or to Scouts.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "The EDGE Method of Teaching (PDF)",
              "url": "https://www.scouting.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/01/Teaching-Edge-Method.pdf"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subrequirement_mode": {
        "type": "all"
      }
    },
    {
      "req_id": "5",
      "path": "5",
      "text": "Retail Crime Prevention. Research the following topics and review them with your counselor:",
      "subrequirements": [
        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "5.a",
          "text": "The impact of shoplifting and employee theft (also known as shrinkage) and loss prevention on retail finances, customer service, and reputation.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "The Impact of Shoplifting on the Retail Industry (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/sQ3m5T4vk3E"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "b",
          "path": "5.b",
          "text": "Techniques used by retail stores to prevent shoplifting.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "How to Prevent Shoplifting (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/j4OJtL7Snko"
            },
            {
              "title": "Retail Loss Prevention Techniques (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/giFprF8nsKg"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subrequirement_mode": {
        "type": "all"
      }
    },
    {
      "req_id": "6",
      "path": "6",
      "text": "Reporting Crime. Discuss the following with your counselor:",
      "subrequirements": [
        {
          "req_id": "a",
          "path": "6.a",
          "text": "When and how to report a crime or an impending crime.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "How to Report a Crime (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/uPWW3S_LLT4"
            },
            {
              "title": "How to Report a Crime - Public Safety Minute (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/aMT6wlCOvEM"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "req_id": "b",
          "path": "6.b",
          "text": "The warning signs for child abuse and domestic violence and how to report these situations."
        },
        {
          "req_id": "c",
          "path": "6.c",
          "text": "The three R's of personal safety and protection and how to apply them."
        },
        {
          "req_id": "d",
          "path": "6.d",
          "text": "How reporting a crime can help law enforcement provide resources for crime victims.",
          "resources": [
            {
              "title": "Importance of Reporting Crime (video)",
              "url": "https://youtu.be/vZbarQJTs1c"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "subrequirement_mode": {
        "type": "all"
      }
    },
    {
